---
import BaseLayout from '../layouts/BaseLayout.astro';
import SEO from '../components/SEO.astro';
---
<BaseLayout>
  <SEO slot="head" title="About Us" description="Learn about FreeToolkit Convert — free online unit conversion tools for everyone." />
  <div class="max-w-3xl mx-auto px-4 py-12">
    <h1 class="text-3xl font-bold text-gray-900 mb-6">About FreeToolkit Convert</h1>
    <div class="prose prose-gray max-w-none">
      <p>FreeToolkit Convert provides free, fast, and accurate unit conversion tools for everyone. Whether you need to convert length, weight, temperature, volume, or any other measurement, our converters are designed to give you instant results.</p>
      <h2>Our Mission</h2>
      <p>We believe that essential tools should be free and accessible to everyone. Our converters work entirely in your browser — no downloads, no sign-ups, no tracking of your data. Just fast, accurate conversions whenever you need them.</p>
      <h2>What We Offer</h2>
      <p>Our toolkit includes 15 specialized converters covering measurement, science, digital, everyday, and math categories. Each converter supports multiple units and provides instant results as you type.</p>
      <h2>Part of FreeToolkit</h2>
      <p>FreeToolkit Convert is part of the <a href="https://freetoolkit.cc" class="text-primary-600 hover:text-primary-700">FreeToolkit</a> family of free online tools. We offer calculators, converters, text tools, and more — all completely free.</p>
    </div>
  </div>
</BaseLayout>
